id: pm-gantt-chart-mdm1
title: Certify pm-gantt-chart on PM CLI/SDK 2026.10.4 and consolidate pending dependency updates
description: "Raise the exact development pin @unbrained/pm-cli to 2026.10.4 together with pm-ops 2026.10.4 and pm-changelog 2026.9.25; carry Dependabot #122 (jscpd 5.x with the zero-duplication gate fixes: shared main-invocation guard, single JSON render in the critical-path test, packed-acceptance PM_PATH isolation), #123 codeql-action SHA group, #124/#125/#126/#127; keep the canonical pm-ops merge-driver launcher byte-identical; certify with the full release gate plus isolated real-tracker dogfooding on npm and Bun."
type: Chore
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[4]: cli,dependencies,release-readiness,sdk
created_at: "2026-10-04T09:32:11.603Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-04T11:10:25.114Z"
author: pi-glm
acceptance_criteria: "npm run release:check passes with configured coverage thresholds and the unchanged zero-duplication gate; pm health with the repo-pinned 2026.10.4 binary is clean; packed tarball passes real-tracker gantt render/export scenarios via npx @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.10.4 and bunx; pm-github managed extension installed with read-only preview only"
actual_result: "Exact devDependency pins completed; CLI/ops/changelog 2026.10.4. Retained fast-glob 3.3.3 restoration and prior provenance commit. Canonical launcher unchanged; unconditional broken-install/lookup tests pass 8/8. Clean npm ci and full serialized release:check PASS: 232/232, 0 skipped, unchanged coverage, duplication zero clones across 27 sources. Packed real tracker npx/bunx renders and JSON/SVG exports pass (95 exported items, npm/Bun JSON byte-identical); scratch removed. pm health ok with stale_in_progress_items:2 advisory; pm-github read-only preview planned 0. Open Dependabot alerts none; prod audit 0; full audit 4 high dev-only reports from unpatched braces 3.0.3 chain. NOT READY; follow-up pm-gantt-chart-e7rd and substantive review availability remain open."
comments[7]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-04T09:32:17.384Z",pi-glm,"Starting at 7145c6f (Release pm-gantt-chart v2026.09.26). Plan: pm-cli 2026.9.23->2026.10.4, pm-ops->2026.10.4, pm-changelog->2026.9.25, jscpd ^4.3.0->^5.4.0 with #122's zero-dup fixes (shared main-invocation guard, single JSON render, accept-packed PM_PATH isolation), codeql SHA 1c5b6756, @types/node 26.6.4, eslint latest in range; carry #122's pm issue pm-gantt-chart-chso; recopy canonical prepare-merge-driver.ts from pm-ops 2026.10.4; full gate + dogfood + pm-github preview."
  "2026-10-04T10:12:35.700Z",pi-glm,"Real-tracker dogfood PASS. Packed pm-gantt-chart-2026.9.26.tgz installed into a scratch copy of this repo's real .agents/pm and registered via pm package install with CLI 2026.10.4 (capabilities incl. commands/schema). npm path (npx -y @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.10.4): pm gantt renders the full real tracker (19 rows, milestones + TODAY marker); pm gantt --group-by status renders grouped; pm gantt export --format json to stdout and --output gantt.json produce correct window/summary/items (projectStart 2026-05-26); pm gantt export --format svg --output roadmap.svg writes a 41109-byte SVG. bun path (bunx @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.10.4): pm gantt renders identically (exit 0); gantt export --format json --output gantt-bun.json writes the same JSON. Scratch deleted after evidence capture. Also repaired the carried pm-gantt-chart-chso history chain drift with pm history-repair (pinned CLI 2026.10.4, 9 entries rehashed, verify_ok), clearing the gate_failing history_drift health finding."
  "2026-10-04T10:13:13.487Z",pi-glm,"pm-github installed as managed project extension at latest npm 2026.10.4 (published during this certification; superseding the earlier 2026.9.26 in the same cycle). Read-only previews against unbraind/pm-gantt-chart: pm github validate -> ok (token via gh CLI, HTTP 200, quota 4916/5000); pm github export --dry-run -> plan only, writes nothing; pm github sync --dry-run -> planned 0, no mutation. No issues created/modified, no scheduled sync enabled."
  "2026-10-04T10:45:06.256Z",pi-glm,"CI correction: exact-head CI failed the Duplication gate with ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND 'fast-glob' imported from pm-ops/dist/duplication.js. Root cause: pm-ops declares fast-glob as an OPTIONAL peer, but its duplication gate hard-requires it at runtime; this repo's direct fast-glob devDependency exists precisely to satisfy that peer, so removing it broke the gate while my earlier local gate passed only against a stale node_modules (npm install had not pruned it at that point; npm ci is authoritative). fast-glob ^3.3.3 restored; npm ci + full npm run release:check PASS again (duplication-gate 0/9209 lines, 27 sources, 0 clone pairs at threshold 0%). npm audit now reports the same pre-existing dev-only braces (GHSA-vfj7-8cjw-p6xm) chain that origin/main also reports (main: 7 high; this branch: 4 high - the eslint 10.12/jscpd 5.4 upgrades shrink it), with no patched braces version published, so it is unfixable in-tree without breaking the pm-ops gate; npm audit --omit=dev remains 0 vulnerabilities, which is the gate this repo enforces. Upstream defect to file: pm-ops's fast-glob peer is not actually optional."
  "2026-10-04T10:58:40.995Z",codex-sol,"Resumed retained worktree, including the unpushed pi-glm release-provenance commit 5869752. Verified exact-head CI now passes after fast-glob restoration. Finish exact devDependency pins, pm-changelog 2026.10.4, and focused canonical-launcher regressions. Full npm audit remains blocked on GHSA-vfj7-8cjw-p6xm: npm braces latest 3.0.3 is affected and fast-glob latest 3.3.3 is required by pm-ops duplication. Record a package follow-up instead of weakening the gate."
  "2026-10-04T11:07:23.556Z",codex-sol,"Resumption validation: clean npm ci and flock-serialized npm run release:check PASS (232/232 tests, 0 skipped; unchanged measured lines/branches/functions thresholds; duplication 0/9239 lines, 27 sources, 0 clones). Launcher suite passed 8/8 with unconditional incomplete/dangling installation and lookup-loop fixtures; canonical launcher unchanged. Real tracker packed dogfood PASS: npx -y @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.10.4 gantt; gantt export --format json --output real.json; gantt export --format svg --output real.svg; bunx @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.10.4 gantt; gantt export --format json --output real-bun.json; JSON/SVG exports contain 95 items and cmp real.json real-bun.json passes. Scratch deleted. npx pm health ok with stale_in_progress_items:2 advisory. Managed pm-github sync --dry-run --repo unbraind/pm-gantt-chart: planned 0. npm audit --omit=dev: 0; full npm audit: 4 high dev-only reports, blocked on unpublished braces fix (follow-up pm-gantt-chart-e7rd). NOT READY for certification despite green production gates."
  "2026-10-04T11:10:24.488Z",codex-sol,"Applied the cross-repo Windows portability finding proactively: new link fixtures use Node junction type with absolute targets, retaining unconditional execution without privileges needed for directory symbolic links. Linux launcher suite 8/8 and zero-duplication gate pass. Windows runtime not available on this host; canonical launcher unchanged."
